        "id": 1407950
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-23T20:44:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Max_request_mv will remain new value until this function is called. When this function is called, max_request_mv will be saved again and changed to appropriate voltage. This is exactly what I observed and described in https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/2773219 in one of comments.\n\nIf this is a problem I can fix it by eg. calling this function from TCPM on voltage change. In my opinion adding another hook (on voltage change) would be an overkill.",
      "parentUuid": "8466908f_dd5536eb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 723,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 723,
        "endChar": 41
      },
